{"unit_id":"Yearngg__dsh-cost-chip#card-zh","repo":"Yearngg/dsh-cost-chip","commit":"8c9703842cf95227f4ec37ad51925c8b4279f5e3","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cost-chip 是 DSH 网页插件，在对话每轮结束处和输入框上方显示 token 用量及按 DeepSeek 峰谷价估算的费用。它从会话 tokenUsage 数据计算输入、缓存命中和输出用量，并按每轮时间应用北京时区的峰时或闲时价格。主要功能包括每轮费用、会话累计费用、悬停查看用量拆分，以及注册 task-token-cost skill 汇总跨会话花费。适合希望直接查看模型用量和费用、或生成历史费用报表的 DSH 用户。无需额外配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:207-290","index.js:30-45"]}
{"unit_id":"Yearngg__dsh-cost-chip#card-en","repo":"Yearngg/dsh-cost-chip","commit":"8c9703842cf95227f4ec37ad51925c8b4279f5e3","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-cost-chip is a DSH web plugin that shows per-turn and session token usage with estimated DeepSeek costs. It applies peak or idle rates to each turn based on Beijing time. Hover for usage breakdowns, or use the bundled skill for reports across local sessions. No extra configuration is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:207-290","index.js:30-45"]}
